{
  "_note": "未来 24 小时(42)。上:气温曲线(curves 平滑 —— 气温是连续量,平滑不伪造信息;金融卡不平滑是另一回事),标出最高 / 最低点;下:逐时降水概率柱(浅蓝,0% 不画)。结论行三态:无雨 / 某点起可能下雨 / 正在下雨。生成器 gen_weather_more.py。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "set",
        "props": {
          "key": "_sky",
          "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${sky},overcast)]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},clear)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#2F7FC4\\,#6FB4E0\\,#A9D2EC)@90|linear(#1F5C90\\,#487F9E\\,#6E9AB0)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},overcast)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#6B7E8E\\,#93A5B2\\,#B9C6CF)@90|linear(#4A5763\\,#6A7783\\,#8A96A0)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},rain)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#3E5A73\\,#5C7B93\\,#89A3B5)@90|linear(#2A3F52\\,#42596C\\,#647D8C)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},snow)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#7C93A8\\,#A8BCCB\\,#D6E3EC)@90|linear(#586A7A\\,#7B8D9B\\,#9FB0BC)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},night)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#101A2E\\,#1C2A44\\,#33465F)@90|linear(#0A1220\\,#141F33\\,#25344A)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "set",
        "props": {
          "key": "_decor",
          "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_sky},clear),glow,if::(eq::(${_sky},overcast),fog,none))]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_decor},glow)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "radial(#8CFFFFFF\\,#00FFFFFF)@0.8\\,0.16\\,0.6|radial(#66FFFFFF\\,#00FFFFFF)@0.8\\,0.16\\,0.6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_decor},fog)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "_note": "⚠️ 雾必须是**一层柔光**,不能是「一条 16pt 高、装着横向渐变的 layer」。\n那种写法横向是渐变(两端透明)、**纵向却是硬边**,于是渲出来是一道齐刷刷的白杠 ——\n用户 2026-08-21 真机反馈的「顶部和小组件有白色横条」就是它,而且因为阴天档最常见,\n页头与四张卡会同时出现。radial 四周都柔,没有任何一条边可以被读成线。\n落点定在偏上(cy=0.34):底部有 DIM 压暗层,雾放下面会被压没。",
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "radial(#2BFFFFFF\\,#00FFFFFF)@0.5\\,0.34\\,0.78|radial(#1EFFFFFF\\,#00FFFFFF)@0.5\\,0.34\\,0.78"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#00000000\\,#4D000000)@90|linear(#00000000\\,#59000000)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "srcDot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#7FC4F5|#7FC4F5"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-71pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${city},--)] · ${@i18n.w_h24T}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{parent.w}-54pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "40pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},--)]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#B3FFFFFF|#A6FFFFFF",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "2"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${rCase},__none__),__none__),0,if::(eq::(${rCase},0),1,0))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "c0",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "32pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.w_rainNone}",
            "fontSize": "11.5pt",
            "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(findNotEmpty::(${rCase},0),1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "c1",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "32pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.w_rainA}${rH}${@i18n.w_rainB}${rP}%",
            "fontSize": "11.5pt",
            "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(findNotEmpty::(${rCase},0),2)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "c2",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14pt",
            "y": "32pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.w_rainNow}${rP}%",
            "fontSize": "11.5pt",
            "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "curve",
        "type": "curves",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "57.0pt",
        "w": "310.0pt",
        "h": "49.0pt",
        "points": "[$[findNotEmpty::(${pts},0\\,999\\,1\\,999)]]",
        "lineWidth": "2pt",
        "lineCap": "round",
        "lineJoin": "round",
        "strokeColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
        "coverageColor": "linear(#40FFFFFF\\,#00FFFFFF)@90|linear(#33FFFFFF\\,#00FFFFFF)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "pbase",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "134.0pt",
        "w": "310.0pt",
        "h": "1pt",
        "bgColor": "#59FFFFFF|#4DFFFFFF"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${tmaxS},__none__),__none__),0,1)]"
